    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73111" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλῐγοχρόν-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
